%% Sequence diagram UC3: datasource and datasource document archiving.
%%{init: {"theme":"base","themeVariables":{"fontFamily":"Arial, sans-serif","fontSize":"16px"},"sequence":{"actorMargin":24,"messageMargin":18,"boxMargin":6,"boxTextMargin":4,"noteMargin":6,"useMaxWidth":true}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin as User
    participant UI as Admin UI
    participant API as HTTP API
    participant Source as Datasource Service
    participant Profile as Profile Service
    participant Store as Vector and Graph Store
    Admin->>UI: Open datasource page
    UI->>API: GET /api/v1/datasources
    API-->>UI: Datasource list
    alt Archive datasource
        Admin->>UI: Confirm datasource archive
        UI->>API: POST /api/v1/datasources/{id}/archive
        API->>Source: Check active profile subscribers
        alt Active subscribers exist
            Source-->>API: Conflict with subscriber count
            API-->>UI: Archive rejected
        else No active subscriber
            Source->>Profile: Remove subscribed projections
            Profile->>Store: Delete vector and graph data
            Source-->>API: Datasource archived
            API-->>UI: Archive success
        end
    else Archive datasource document
        Admin->>UI: Open datasource detail
        UI->>API: GET /api/v1/datasources/{id}/documents
        API-->>UI: Document list
        Admin->>UI: Confirm document archive
        UI->>API: POST /api/v1/datasources/{id}/documents/{doc}/archive
        API->>Profile: Remove document projections
        Profile->>Store: Delete vector and graph data
        API-->>UI: Document archived
    end
    opt Unarchive
        UI->>API: POST .../unarchive
        API->>Source: Restore active status
        Source->>Profile: Fan out document to subscribers
        API-->>UI: Unarchive success
    end
